. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * 
. // The dependent variable is a standardised index of gender equality
. // Higher values indicate more support for gender equality
. // Variable of interest is the independent variables daughters, which equals 
> 1
.         // if respondents only have daughters vs. only sons
. // We run a linear OLS regression analysis with additional 
.         // pre-determined covariates
.         
. reg std_index_H1 daughters i.age_first_birth i.sex i.migback i.l11101 ///
